{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1c2dfdf7-4172-8c3b-a048-366c94249094",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T13:06:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gerard Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:02:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:02:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. Is it all right if I ask about a flooded road? I'm not sure if I've got the right department."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:02:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you're in the right place. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:02:48-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, there's a low spot at the end of my block, and it's under about a foot of water. Still. It's Wednesday, and the storm was last weekend, Saturday into Sunday. That's three days now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:03:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a foot of water, three days after. Where's the block?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:03:08-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "141 Annandale Road, in the North End. The low spot's at the far end from me, where the road dips. Is it all right if I say it's the same spot every time it rains? Because it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:03:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, say it. So this has happened before there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:03:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Every decent storm, yes. And it never drains down like it ought to. Somebody's supposed to look at it and nobody ever seems to come. I'd like to know why it just sits there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:03:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not what you want to hear after three days. How deep would you say it is, if you had to guess? Like against a car?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:03:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up to the hubcaps. I watched a fellow in a little sedan turn around rather than try it. The neighbors are walking the long way around to the main road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:04:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hubcaps, got it. I'm writing that down. Low spot, end of Annandale, water about hubcap deep, standing since the weekend storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:04:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. Is it all right if I ask whether somebody's actually going to come out? Or does this just go in a pile?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:04:28-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It goes to the crew supervisor, and they'll decide whether it's a drain that's clogged or just an area that holds water. After a nor'easter the crews are working through a long list, so I can't give you an hour. But it's logged with today's date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:04:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's what I figured. A long list. It's always a long list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:04:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Do you want me to put a callback number on it so somebody can tell you what they find?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:05:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please. And is it all right if I ask that they call when it's done, not just when they've looked? I don't want to hear they looked and nothing was done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:05:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll note it that way. Call back when the work is finished. What's the number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:05:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0170. That's the landline."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:05:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven oh. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:05:31-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Could I ask one more thing? Is there an email or a web form I should use next time? I have a desktop, but it's old and takes ten minutes to start up, so I'd rather know it's worth it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:05:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The city website has a request form, yeah, but honestly the phone's faster. Call here anytime and we'll log it the same way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:05:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then I'll just call. Ten minutes to start, I'd be waiting for the water to go down first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:06:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Anything else on this one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:06:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. I'd just like it looked at properly this time. It's been the same story too long."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:06:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's in with your callback request. Take care, Mr. Doyle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:06:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
